{"id":"vod_bf_1119","vodId":"1119","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"ALDNOAH.ZERO第一季","name_cn":"ALDNOAH.ZERO第一季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-2/b71c6fa298cd9f95481921ca693d86a4.jpg"},"summary":"约四十年前，人类在火星发现史前文明“Aldnoah”科技。伴随着火星殖民进程与科技垄断主张，火星开拓民与地球之间的摩擦越发扩大。　　2014年，处于休战状态的地球与火星正在进行和平谈判。火星“薇瑟帝国“公主艾瑟依拉姆（雨宫天 配音）以亲善大使的身份访问地球，为打破坚冰做出努力。她的游行车却在日本新芦原市遭到恐怖分子的导弹攻击。火星帝国将其视为地球的宣战公告，随即对地球各国发出攻击，两个星球间的战火再次爆发。受过格斗技与人形战斗兵器训练的地球高中生界冢伊奈帆（花江夏树 配音）与伙伴们加入机甲骑兵战斗。与此同时，公主的侍从斯雷因（小野贤章 配音）亦卷入战争，为救出帝国公主而努力。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 16:12:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ALDNOAHZEROdiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ALDNOAHZEROdiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ALDNOAHZEROdiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ALDNOAHZEROdiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ALDNOAHZEROdiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ALDNOAHZEROdiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ALDNOAHZEROdiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ALDNOAHZEROdiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ALDNOAHZEROdiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ALDNOAHZEROdiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ALDNOAHZEROdiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/ALDNOAHZEROdiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:42:16.319Z"}